      "question": "Does my current plan have to change?",
      "answer": "No, existing plans are generally exempt under federal law. Plans established before December 29, 2022, are grandfathered under 26 U.S.C. 414A(c), though an exempt employer may still choose to offer automatic enrollment voluntarily."
    },
